      "rationale": "This column directly operationalizes the query's core metric -- the decline rate per department -- providing the exact axis needed to compare departments. Values are derived aggregates from the department + state columns present in the table; the per-department constancy across rows (e.g. 0.0491... repeated) is consistent with a group-level statistic and is a sound reading of the data."
    },
    {
      "name": "department_avg_amount",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.85,
      "source_groundedness": 0.9,
